                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This [b]seems[/b] like it could be a pretty cool social app that has a great idea at its core.  However, the lack of a community and things to do really make it not recommendable at this current time.  It has good visuals, but it has only 1 environment and it's a pretty small spaced environment.  \n\nCommunity garden could be a great VR community, but it's just too simplified at this point.  You go to the vending machine, pull the lever, this random package of seeds comes out.  You literally drop the box of seeds into the ground and then you water the box of seeds with the only tool in your hand (a water gun).  That pretty much sums up the game.  \n\nI hope I can revisit this game and change my recommendation to yes.  But I'd be lying if I said yes now at this current state of the game.  There's just nothing to do.  Sorry dev, you clearly worked hard and put effort into this idea. It's just too barren at this point.  I hope the experience improves and it becomes a huge success, but I also wouldn't blame the dev if he or she abandoned the project completely.  It will more than likely be a labor of love that sees no profit.\n\nRate 3/10 even at free, there's not much reason to download this app :(",
